issue_context.body:
#### Expected Behavior
`CBOE` custom data `EndTime` is calculated with `config.Increment`.

#### Actual Behavior
`CBOE` custom data `EndTime` is calculated with the default one-minute period.

#### Reproducing the Problem
```csharp
using QuantConnect.Data;
using QuantConnect.Data.Custom.CBOE;
using QuantConnect.Indicators;

namespace QuantConnect.Algorithm.CSharp.AltData {
    public class CachedAlternativeDataAlgorithm : QCAlgorithm {
        private Symbol _cboeVix;
        private BollingerBands _bb;

        public override void Initialize() {
            SetStartDate(2003, 1, 1);
            _cboeVix = AddData<CBOE>("VIX", Resolution.Daily).Symbol;
            _bb = BB(_cboeVix, 30, 2, MovingAverageType.Simple, Resolution.Daily);
        }

        public override void OnData(Slice data) {
            if (!data.ContainsKey(_cboeVix)) return;

            var vix = data.Get<CBOE>(_cboeVix);
            Log($"VIX: {vix} {_bb}");
        }
    }
}
```
`_bb` is always zero because the consolidator doesn't update it since `EndTimeIsInNativeResolution` is false.

